  /// Determines which newly created destination log groups are encrypted with
  /// the configured KmsKeyArn when EncryptionStrategy is CUSTOMER_MANAGED .
  /// If you set this to ENCRYPTED_SOURCE_ONLY (the default), only destination
  /// log groups whose source log group is encrypted with a customer managed
  /// KMS key use the configured KmsKeyArn . Destination log groups derived
  /// from Amazon Web Services owned encrypted source log groups remain Amazon
  /// Web Services owned encrypted. If you set this to
  /// NEW_DESTINATION_LOG_GROUPS , every new destination log group created by
  /// this rule uses the configured KmsKeyArn , regardless of the source log
